      },
      "text": "**Connection to differential-geometry/**: The statistical manifold is literally a Riemannian manifold — see that directory for the definition and machinery of Riemannian geometry. The Fisher information metric IS a Riemannian metric."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-INFORMATION-GEOMETRY.md#009",
      "path": [
        "09-INFORMATION-GEOMETRY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
