        "title": "Information Geometry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  Point in manifold:     a distribution p(x; theta)\n  Tangent vector at p:   partial_theta log p(x; theta) = score function\n  Riemannian metric:     Fisher information matrix g_ij(theta)"
    },
